  abstract    = {Examines how repeated use of large language models may alter users' perceptions of their own expertise. Draws on cognitive science (Dunning-Kruger, metacognition, cognitive offloading, cognitive surrender) to argue for epistemic humility and sharper AI literacy, with emphasis on health misinformation, Indigenous knowledge systems, and science communication.},
